e components, steering equipment, and other appendages. Requiring machineryComponentType alone does not identify or restrict the applicable component kinds, so unrelated components are overconstrained and applicable-component scope is not executable.","required_change":"Encode applicability by restricting or conditionally qualifying nltl:hasComponent values to the four required component kinds, then require the corresponding approval evidence for each applicable component.","regression_guard":"Preserve the ship-to-component-to-approvalRecord paths and approval requirements while limiting enforcement to the required scantling component kinds.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":true,"source":"SEMANTIC"},{"category":"UNIT","location":"IMO-049-ice-concentration / qudt:unit","problem":"The quantity unit constraint uses qudt:UNITLESS, which expands to http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/UNITLESS, but the canonical recommended unit for operatingIceConcentration is http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS. This can reject correctly represented dimensionless quantities and accepts the wrong unit resource.","required_change":"Constrain qudt:unit to <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS> using the QUDT unit vocabulary namespace.","regression_guard":"Preserve the decimal numeric-value requirement and the dimensionless-unit requirement for operatingIceConcentration.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"}],"generator_elapsed_ms":23057.863,"validator_elapsed_ms":27451.044}
